  requires $\forall i < W, \left(\forall \operatorname{lo} < \left(2\right)^{\operatorname{halfLo}\left(w\right)}, \left(\left(\operatorname{Tbar}_{\left(\left(\left(\operatorname{tOff} \cdot \left(W \cdot \left(2\right)^{\operatorname{halfLo}\left(w\right)}\right)\right) + \left(i \cdot \left(2\right)^{\operatorname{halfLo}\left(w\right)}\right)\right) + \operatorname{lo}\right)} = \operatorname{gePhaseWord}\left(w, \operatorname{tOff}, i, \operatorname{lo}\right)\right)\right)\right)$
