  ensures $\sum_{z < \left(2\right)^{\operatorname{dim}}} \left(\left(\alpha\left(z\right) \cdot \left(\ket{\operatorname{setReg}\left(\operatorname{setReg}\left(\operatorname{setReg}\left(\operatorname{setReg}\left(\operatorname{setReg}\left(\operatorname{setReg}\left(z, \operatorname{outBase}, \operatorname{outWidth}\left(\operatorname{bits}, \operatorname{gSep}, \operatorname{pieceLen}\right), 0\right), \operatorname{ancBase}, w, 0\right), \operatorname{ppLow}, \left(2\right)^{\operatorname{halfLo}\left(w\right)}, 0\right), \operatorname{ppHigh}, \left(2\right)^{\operatorname{halfHi}\left(w\right)}, 0\right), \operatorname{ctrl}, 1, 1\right), \operatorname{runBase}, \left(\operatorname{pieceCount}\left(\operatorname{bits}, \operatorname{gSep}\right) \cdot \operatorname{pieceLen}\right), \operatorname{runwayLookupAdd}\left(\operatorname{bits}, \operatorname{gSep}, \operatorname{pieceLen}, \operatorname{getReg}\left(z, \operatorname{runBase}, \left(\operatorname{pieceCount}\left(\operatorname{bits}, \operatorname{gSep}\right) \cdot \operatorname{pieceLen}\right)\right), T_{\left(\operatorname{tOff} + \operatorname{getReg}\left(z, \operatorname{addrBase}, w\right)\right)}\right)\right)}_{q_{\operatorname{band}\left(0, \operatorname{cb}, 1\right)}} \otimes \ket{\operatorname{shr}\left(\operatorname{setReg}\left(\operatorname{setReg}\left(\operatorname{setReg}\left(\operatorname{setReg}\left(\operatorname{setReg}\left(\operatorname{setReg}\left(z, \operatorname{outBase}, \operatorname{outWidth}\left(\operatorname{bits}, \operatorname{gSep}, \operatorname{pieceLen}\right), 0\right), \operatorname{ancBase}, w, 0\right), \operatorname{ppLow}, \left(2\right)^{\operatorname{halfLo}\left(w\right)}, 0\right), \operatorname{ppHigh}, \left(2\right)^{\operatorname{halfHi}\left(w\right)}, 0\right), \operatorname{ctrl}, 1, 1\right), \operatorname{runBase}, \left(\operatorname{pieceCount}\left(\operatorname{bits}, \operatorname{gSep}\right) \cdot \operatorname{pieceLen}\right), \o