  assumes $\sum_{z < \left(2\right)^{\operatorname{dim}}} \left(\left(\alpha\left(z\right) \cdot \ket{\operatorname{setReg}\left(z, \operatorname{ppBase}, \left(2\right)^{k}, 0\right)}_{q_{\operatorname{band}\left(0, \operatorname{dim}, 1\right)}}\right)\right)$
  ensures $\sum_{z < \left(2\right)^{\operatorname{dim}}} \left(\left(\alpha\left(z\right) \cdot \ket{\operatorname{setReg}\left(z, \operatorname{ppBase}, \left(2\right)^{k}, \operatorname{ppWord}\left(k, \operatorname{getReg}\left(z, \operatorname{addrBase}, k\right)\right)\right)}_{q_{\operatorname{band}\left(0, \operatorname{dim}, 1\right)}}\right)\right)$
